    "text": "Men \u00fea leofostan, us lyst nu eow secgan be \u00feam halgan godspelle \u00fee ge gehyrdon nu r\u00e6dan, \u00fe\u00e6t ge beon\nSe godspellere Iohannes, \u00fee w\u00e6s Godes dyrling, Cristes moddrian sunu, s\u00e6de on \u00fe\u00e6re Cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re byrig w\u00e6s geh\u00e6fd, gehende \u00feam temple, an wundorlic w\u00e6terscipe, Bethsaida gehaten; \u00feone\nOn \u00feam w\u00e6terscipe wurdon wundra gelome \u00feurh \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan God, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he his engel asende of\n\u00de\u00e6r lagon \u00fea for\u00fei on \u00feam fores\u00e6dum porticum fela untrumra manna mislice gebrocode, blindra and\n\u00de\u00e6r l\u00e6g \u00fea sum beddryda andbidigende \u00fe\u00e6s ylcan, eahta and \u00ferittig wintra on his untrumnysse.\n\u00d0a \u00fea se H\u00e6lend \u00feider com, swa swa we \u00e6r s\u00e6don, and wiste be \u00feam men \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s lange untrum,\nSe lama him andwyrde, La leof, ic n\u00e6bbe n\u00e6nne mannan \u00fee mage me into \u00feam w\u00e6terscipe don \u00e6fter\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend him to, Aris hal of \u00f0am bedde, and ber \u00fein legerbed gangende heonon.\nSe man \u00fea sona mihtiglice wear\u00f0 geh\u00e6led, and b\u00e6r his legerbed on his b\u00e6ce, and eode.\nHit w\u00e6s \u00fea S\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g \u00fea \u00feis geworden w\u00e6s; \u00feone d\u00e6g wur\u00feodon \u00fea Iudeiscan mid freolse, \u00e6fter\nSe man him andwyrde anr\u00e6dlice and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Se \u00f0e me geh\u00e6lde, he het me niman min bed and gan; and\nAnd se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r geh\u00e6led w\u00e6s nyste hw\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend w\u00e6s, and se H\u00e6lend \u00fea eode of \u00fe\u00e6re meniu.\nSy\u00fe\u00f0an eft se H\u00e6lend geseah \u00feone mann binnan \u00feam temple, and him bebead \u00feas word: Efne nu \u00feu\nWe habba\u00f0 nu ges\u00e6d sceortlice \u00feis godspel anfealdum andgite, and we eac willa\u00f0 eow secgan \u00fe\u00e6t\nSe w\u00e6terscipe w\u00e6s beworht mid fif porticum, and h\u00e6fde getacnunge, swa swa se trahtnere seg\u00f0,\nOn \u00feam porticum lagon alefode and adlige, blinde and healte, and on handum forscruncene.\nSwa w\u00e6ron \u00fea Iudei wanhale on mode, and on heora geleafan alefode for\u00feearle, for \u00feam \u00f0e Moys\u00e6s \u00e6\n\u00dea beo\u00fe blinde on mode \u00fee ne magon geseon \u00fe\u00e6s geleafan leoht, \u00feeah hi locion brade; and \u00fea beo\u00f0\nSe h\u00e6f\u00f0 forscruncene hand \u00fee n\u00e6f\u00f0 mildheortnysse weorc, and bi\u00fe unw\u00e6stmb\u00e6re, and \u00e6fre fordrugod.\nBe swilcum cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend on his halgan godspelle, \u00fea \u00fea sum lama l\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r he l\u00e6rde \u00fe\u00e6t folc:\nSwilce he w\u00e6re gemanod mid \u00feam mihtigan wundre, astrece \u00feine hand, \u00fee \u00e6r w\u00e6s uncystig, to\nSwilce wanhale lagon wi\u00f0innan \u00feam porticon, ac se \u00e6lmihtiga H\u00e6lend \u00fee of heofenum astah mancyn to\nHys nama is H\u00e6lend, for \u00fean \u00fee he geh\u00e6l\u00fe his folc, swa swa se engel cw\u00e6\u00fe be him, \u00e6r \u00fean \u00fee he\nMicele mare wundor is \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde beon mann on \u00feisum life, and alysan us \u00feurh hine, \u00feonne \u00fea\nWitodlice seo sawul \u00fee fram synnum bi\u00f0 geh\u00e6led, and on geleafan \u00feurhwuna\u00f0, f\u00e6r\u00f0 of \u00feisum life to\nHe bi\u00f0 swa\u00feeah geh\u00e6led to ansundre h\u00e6le eft on Domesd\u00e6g, \u00feonne he of dea\u00fee arist, and sy\u00fe\u00f0an ne\nOn \u00feam w\u00e6terscipe w\u00e6ron twa wundorlice mihta, an \u00feurh \u00feone engel, o\u00feer \u00feurh \u00feone H\u00e6lend.\n\u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6s engles styrunge eode in se \u00f0e mihte, and w\u00e6s sona geh\u00e6led fram his seocnysse, and se \u00fee\nAn w\u00e6s geh\u00e6led \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s engles tocyme, and \u00e6nne geh\u00e6lde se H\u00e6lend on his tocyme, for \u00f0\u00e6re\n\u00deurh \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6teres styrunge w\u00e6s eac getacnod \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes \u00ferowung, \u00feurh \u00fea h\u00e6l becom eallum\n\u00c6nne he geh\u00e6lde \u00fea of eallum \u00feam untrumum, se \u00f0e mid anum worde ea\u00f0elice mihte hi ealle\nEahta and \u00ferittig wintra wunode se bedryda on \u00feam legerbedde, anbidigende his h\u00e6le, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylf\nLege \u00feas twa beboda to \u00feam twam l\u00e6s feowertigum \u00fe\u00e6s langsuman legeres \u00fe\u00e6s laman beddrydan,\nFram \u00fe\u00e6re fulfremednysse f\u00e6r\u00f0 se man \u00e6mptig, se \u00f0e n\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fea so\u00fean lufe his Scippendes and manna.\nSo\u00felice \u00feis getel w\u00e6s gesett gefyrn, \u00fea \u00fea Moyses f\u00e6ste feowertig daga, and Godes \u00e6 sette be Godes\nEft \u00fea ure H\u00e6lend on hys andweardnysse f\u00e6ste feowertig daga, \u00feurh his agenne fultum; \u00feurh \u00feone\n\u00d0is w\u00e6s se ordfruma ures Lenctenes, and \u00feus gegrundweallod \u00feurh God sylfne \u00e6r, and us is to\nNu is o\u00feer f\u00e6sten us eac to healdenne, swa swa se apostol Paulus on his pistole awrat, \u00fe\u00e6t we us\n\u00deis f\u00e6sten \u00e6r Eastran we f\u00e6sta\u00f0 mid geswince, and we freolslice sy\u00fe\u00fean fiftig daga lybba\u00f0, o\u00fe \u00fea\n\u00dereo \u00feing bebead se H\u00e6lend \u00feam bedrydan: \u00fe\u00e6t is, aris, and ber \u00fein legerbed, and gang.\nHe geh\u00e6lde his untrumnysse mid \u00feam \u00fee he het hine arisan, and swa\u00feeah seo d\u00e6d getacnode sum\nBer \u00fein legerbed, \u00fe\u00e6t is, beo ge\u00feyldig, and forber \u00feine nextan, swa swa \u00feu betst m\u00e6ge, teonfullan\nUre \u00e6lc sceal mid lufe o\u00f0rum fylstan, and eac ure yfelnysse us betwynan forberan, \u00fe\u00e6t Godes \u00e6 on us\nSo\u00f0lice Cristes \u00e6 is seo so\u00fee lufu, and seo ne by\u00f0 gefylled buton we swa don \u00fe\u00e6t we ure byr\u00feena\nCrist het hine gan, \u00fe\u00e6t is on godra weorca stapum for\u00f0st\u00e6ppan, and ne standan idel.\nHe b\u00e6r \u00fea his bed bli\u00feelice gangende, and \u00fea Iudeiscan ceorodon for \u00f0am S\u00e6ternesd\u00e6ge, \u00feone hi\nGod gesceop his gesceafta on syx dagum ealle, and geswac on \u00feone seofo\u00fean, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he sy\u00fe\u00fean ne\nHe gesceop \u00fea twegen men, and ealle tida gesette, ac he ne gesceop na sy\u00fe\u00fean seldcu\u00fee gesceafta, of\nNu ge magon tocnawan \u00fe\u00e6t ure sawla ne cuma\u00f0 of f\u00e6der ne of meder, ac se heofonlica F\u00e6der gescip\u00f0\nNu smeaga\u00f0 menn for oft hw\u00e6r hit eal becume \u00fee fram Adame w\u00e6s o\u00f0 \u00f0is gesceapen, ac hi nyton \u00fe\u00e6t\nSe ylca restend\u00e6g, swa swa we r\u00e6ddan lyttle \u00e6r, getacnode \u00feone d\u00e6g \u00fee ure Drihten for\u00f0faren on\nOn \u00feam ealdan restend\u00e6ge, \u00fee we \u00e6r embe spr\u00e6con, ne worhton \u00fea Iudei nan \u00feeowtlic weorc, and se\n\u00dea Iudeiscan freolsodon \u00feone fores\u00e6dan restend\u00e6g, and oft bem\u00e6ndon \u00fea \u00f0a men w\u00e6ron geh\u00e6lede on\n\u00dea axode he hi on sumne s\u00e6l be sumum w\u00e6terseocum men hw\u00e6\u00f0er he on \u00feam freolsd\u00e6ge \u00fee hi swa\nHi suwodon \u00fea ealle, and se H\u00e6lend sona \u00feone w\u00e6terseocan geh\u00e6lde on heora gesih\u00feum, and axode\nAnd hi \u00fea ne mihton nan \u00feing him geandwyrdan, for \u00fean \u00fee hi w\u00e6ron oferswy\u00fede.\nSe geh\u00e6leda mann gemette \u00feone H\u00e6lend sy\u00fe\u00fean on \u00feam temple, and he him s\u00e6de \u00feas word: Nu \u00feu\nMid \u00feam he geswutelode \u00fe\u00e6t he for synnum w\u00e6s gebrocod, ac swa\u00feeah ne beo\u00f0 ealle untrume for\nSume beo\u00fe geuntrumode \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fee eadmodran beon, sume for fandunge, sume for Godes wundrum,\nSe geh\u00e6leda man \u00fea, sy\u00fe\u00fean he \u00feone H\u00e6lend gespr\u00e6c, cydde \u00feam Iudeiscum \u00fe\u00e6t Crist hine geh\u00e6lde,\n\u00deam sy wuldor on ecnysse mid his \u00e6lmihtigan F\u00e6der and \u00feam Halgan Gaste on anre Godcundnysse,",
